===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|id=earth|inh|enm>ground>surface|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|ground}}, from {{inh|en|ang|grund}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*grunduz}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|grûn}}, {{cog|nl|grond}} and {{cog|de|Grund}}.

