#* {{quote-web|1=en|date=2019-04-10|author=Ben Walker (AP)|title=Twins Pitchers Go Wild, Syndergaard and Mets Stroll 9-6|site=Yahoo! Sports|url=https://sports.yahoo.com/twins-pitchers-wild-syndergaard-mets-stroll-9-6-023744747--mlb.html|text=The Twins scored three times in the eighth to make it 9-4 and loaded the bases with no outs. Jeurys Familia got Willians Astudillo to '''ground''' into a double play, limiting the damage.|accessdate=11 April 2019|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20190411173529/https://sports.yahoo.com/twins-pitchers-wild-syndergaard-mets-stroll-9-6-023744747--mlb.html|archivedate=11 April 2019}}
# To [[place]] [[something]] on the [[#Noun|ground]].
