#: {{ux|en|The ship '''grounded''' on the bar.}}
# To [[found]]; to [[fix]] or [[set]], as on a [[foundation]], [[reason]], or [[principle]]; to [[furnish]] a [[#Noun|ground]] for; to fix [[firmly]].
#* {{RQ:KJV|Ephesians|3|17|passage=being rooted and '''grounded''' in love}}
